' Supporting specification: spec.md
@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 50
skinparam ranksep 75
title Unified learning: proposed component view v0.1
component "Synthetic journey tests" as Tests
component "invo-learn skill" as Skill
interface "S1: invo-learn commands" as Commands
component "Command adapter" as CLI
component "Study module\ncourses / assignments\npackets / evidence" as Study
component "Explicit migration\nlegacy readers" as Migrate
component "Installer / updater" as Update
artifact "Private records, archives\nand shared mailbox" as Records
artifact "Legacy snapshots\nread-only originals" as Legacy
artifact "Installed harness\nbundle" as Bundle
Tests -[hidden]right-> Skill
Tests ..> Commands : exercises
Skill ..> Commands : invokes
CLI -up- Commands
CLI ..> Study : study / reports
CLI ..> Migrate : explicit migration
CLI ..> Update : setup / update
Study -[hidden]right-> Migrate
Migrate -[hidden]right-> Update
Study ..> Records : reads / writes
Migrate ..> Legacy : reads
Migrate ..> Records : verified import
Update ..> Bundle : replaces bundle
legend bottom
  Proposed dependencies, not runtime execution order. All files stay private.
  S1: exercise public commands; assert returned results, files and installed behavior.
  Real temporary files / Git; controlled release / remote responses.
  Migration requires report reconciliation, rehearsal, preservation and recovery checks.
  Ordinary updates never reorganize learner records.
  Portable teaching evaluations complement S1; no automated chatbot integration.
endlegend
@enduml
